@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to upgrade a station with a building
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows a station list and asks to select one
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a station
    activate System

        System --> Employee : requests upgrade details (i.e. type of building, size)
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : types requested data
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows all data and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms the upgrade
    activate System

        System --> Employee : displays operation success
    deactivate System
@enduml